{
  "notes": [
    "DoStartSpellAction0x06014B1B activates Action when usable and subscribes finish callback; OnStartSpellActionFinished0x06014B1C then activates Death. false DeathAfterAllMissilesFire is not a wait-until-impact instruction.",
